hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1268","Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan ke aakhri ashrey mein etikaf farmaya kartey they. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1269","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan ke aakhri ashrey mein etikaf farmaya kartey they, yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko wafaat di, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki azwaaj etikaf karti rahein. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1270","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har Ramazan mein das din etikaf farmaya kartey they, phir jab wo saal aaya jis mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafaat hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bees din etikaf farmaya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
